<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The five pages of webfpv.org, which are three separate services behind one
  domain: this landing page and its wiki are a static site, /sim/ is the
  simulator's Render static site and /board/ is the board's Render web
  service, joined by the Cloudflare Worker in the simulator's edge/router.js.

  The wiki's articles are hash routes off /wiki/, so they cannot be listed
  here as URLs of their own. What makes them findable is the per article
  document.title in src/wiki/wiki.js and the links out of /wiki/ itself.

  Hand maintained, and short enough that it should be. If a sixth page ever
  appears, it goes here.
-->
